  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="882e6b0a-82ca-587a-aa89-e0694ab1d0f1" activityNameId="dc043535-7161-5dfd-84cf-67b91adb3c45" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Photovoltaic laminate, CdTe, First Solar Series 6, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Photovoltaic laminate, CdTe, First Solar Series 6, at plant
Production of photovoltaic thin film modules by vapour deposition. The Series 4 modules produced at First Solar have an area of 2.47 m2 and a weight of 14.2kg/m2.;
Synonyms: Solarmodul, PV-module, cadmium telluride, thin film; 
UUID: 39e223e8-8c94-3a11-95f1-b20c982b9f55
This dataset includes the raw and auxiliary materials, electricity, natural gas and water used to manufacture CdTe Series 6 PV modules at First Solar in the US. The transport of raw materials, the disposal of wastes, the infrastructure and pollutant emissions to air and water are also included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Production technology of thin film cells. Sublimation of the powders and condensation of the vapours on a glass substrate by vapour transport deposition (VTD).
Time period: Data refer to production in 2017-2018.
Production volume: 2600 MW total production by First Solar in 2018.
Sampling: Producer information 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_39e223e8-8c94-3a11-95f1-b20c982b9f55.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
